==Battleground==
*10 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Great Angel Chibinel]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**1 [[Great Angel Chibinel]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Bring a decent crit unit and you win.

